- [Hosted CI for `a798639084d5`](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/42667561019) passed. The [required CI and security gate](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/42669466035) also passed on that commit.

- **Red on `6edcaa28edb7`, green on `a798639084d5`.** With a 60-second startup budget and a live peer holding the retired process, the new test advances five seconds and then releases the peer. On the base, startup was still waiting and could resume. With the fix, it has already rejected and preserved the healthy client. The existing one-second startup-timeout control passes on both.
